#showas:泡泡血浴
Disclaimer--Very Challenging
Three formidable AI's--The Golemite, the Swarmer, and the Fortress Baron--reside on the fringes of the galaxy. Astro trains fund massive projects that will be used against you; but their trains can be raided for technology and wealth. AIP Reducers are plentiful, if you can find them. But be careful where you raid, lest you wake the Dark Spire. Wake them, if you dare.